{"id":34675,"date":"2026-04-02T16:41:10","date_gmt":"2026-04-02T12:41:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/?p=34675"},"modified":"2026-04-24T15:28:06","modified_gmt":"2026-04-24T11:28:06","slug":"benchmark-des-salaires-au-senegal","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/fr\/benchmark-des-salaires-au-senegal\/","title":{"rendered":"Benchmark des salaires au S\u00e9n\u00e9gal"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"34675\" class=\"elementor elementor-34675\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-af62423 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"af62423\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-9aad164\" data-id=\"9aad164\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c99cb2 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2c99cb2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"466\">Dans un contexte de transformation digitale et d\u2019internationalisation des \u00e9quipes, les entreprises recherchent des solutions efficaces pour acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des comp\u00e9tences qualifi\u00e9es tout en ma\u00eetrisant leurs co\u00fbts. Le benchmark des salaires au S\u00e9n\u00e9gal devient ainsi un levier strat\u00e9gique pour structurer des \u00e9quipes \u00e0 distance, en t\u00e9l\u00e9travail ou via des mod\u00e8les externalis\u00e9s.<\/p><p data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"806\">Le S\u00e9n\u00e9gal s\u2019impose aujourd\u2019hui comme un hub dynamique pour les services externalis\u00e9s, notamment dans les domaines du support client, du d\u00e9veloppement IT, de la finance et du marketing digital. Dakar, en particulier, attire de nombreuses entreprises gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une main-d\u2019\u0153uvre qualifi\u00e9e, francophone et adapt\u00e9e aux standards internationaux.<\/p><p data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"1129\">Cependant, pour collaborer efficacement avec ces talents, il est essentiel de comprendre les niveaux de r\u00e9mun\u00e9ration et les enjeux de conformit\u00e9. Les solutions d\u2019Employer of Record (EOR) permettent de travailler avec des talents sans cr\u00e9er d\u2019entit\u00e9 locale, tout en s\u00e9curisant les aspects juridiques et administratifs.<\/p><p data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1366\">Pr\u00e9sente dans neuf pays Maurice, Madagascar, Kenya, Rwanda, Maroc, Tunisie, C\u00f4te d\u2019Ivoire, S\u00e9n\u00e9gal et Cameroun Breedj accompagne les entreprises dans la gestion de la paie, la conformit\u00e9 et la structuration d\u2019\u00e9quipes externalis\u00e9es.<\/p><h2 data-section-id=\"dl23pn\" data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1416\">Le S\u00e9n\u00e9gal : un hub en pleine croissance<\/h2><p data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1603\">Le S\u00e9n\u00e9gal est reconnu pour son d\u00e9veloppement rapide dans les services digitaux et externalis\u00e9s. Le pays b\u00e9n\u00e9ficie d\u2019un environnement \u00e9conomique stable et d\u2019un \u00e9cosyst\u00e8me en croissance.<\/p><p data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1633\">Les secteurs cl\u00e9s incluent :<\/p><ul data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1797\"><li data-section-id=\"2yef06\" data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1675\">Support client et centres de contact<\/li><li data-section-id=\"e616vy\" data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1703\">D\u00e9veloppement web et IT<\/li><li data-section-id=\"6alixy\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1731\">Finance et comptabilit\u00e9<\/li><li data-section-id=\"g60hdi\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1753\">Marketing digital<\/li><li data-section-id=\"85f7sk\" data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1797\">Fonctions administratives externalis\u00e9es<\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1960\">La forte ma\u00eetrise du fran\u00e7ais, combin\u00e9e \u00e0 une ouverture internationale, permet aux talents s\u00e9n\u00e9galais de collaborer efficacement avec des entreprises \u00e9trang\u00e8res.<\/p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\u00a0<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4057ed8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4057ed8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\u00a0<\/h3><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Le S\u00e9n\u00e9gal s\u2019impose comme un hub cl\u00e9 pour les services externalis\u00e9s en Afrique de l\u2019Ouest.<\/h3><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c16ba3d elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"c16ba3d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md\" href=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/fr\/rejoignez-nous\/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Devenez membre Breedj<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1226fb4 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1226fb4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-section-id=\"1a0qjyi\" data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2023\">Pourquoi les entreprises se tournent vers ces talents<\/h2><p data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2162\">Les entreprises recherchent aujourd\u2019hui flexibilit\u00e9 et performance. Le S\u00e9n\u00e9gal offre un \u00e9quilibre int\u00e9ressant entre comp\u00e9tences et co\u00fbts.<\/p><p data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2189\">Les raisons principales :<\/p><ul data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2341\"><li data-section-id=\"4i7af4\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2224\">Acc\u00e8s \u00e0 des talents qualifi\u00e9s<\/li><li data-section-id=\"1m7dnjm\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2255\">Flexibilit\u00e9 op\u00e9rationnelle<\/li><li data-section-id=\"dxmcmn\" data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2295\">Capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 travailler en distanciel<\/li><li data-section-id=\"11p71uz\" data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2341\">Exp\u00e9rience dans les services externalis\u00e9s<\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2593\"><strong data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2402\">Est-il facile de travailler avec ce profil au S\u00e9n\u00e9gal ?<\/strong><br data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2405\" \/>Oui. Les professionnels s\u00e9n\u00e9galais sont habitu\u00e9s aux environnements internationaux, aux outils collaboratifs et au travail \u00e0 distance. Avec un cadre structur\u00e9, la collaboration est fluide.<\/p><p data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2593\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Benchmark-des-salaires-au-Senegal-Breedj.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-34690\" src=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Benchmark-des-salaires-au-Senegal--1024x835.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"652\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Benchmark-des-salaires-au-Senegal--1024x835.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Benchmark-des-salaires-au-Senegal--300x245.png 300w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Benchmark-des-salaires-au-Senegal--768x626.png 768w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Benchmark-des-salaires-au-Senegal-.png 1300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-40a3590 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"40a3590\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md\" href=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Benchmark-des-salaires-au-Senegal-Breedj.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">T\u00e9l\u00e9charger le pdf<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa629b8 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fa629b8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-section-id=\"sx1dfz\" data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2636\">Comp\u00e9tences et forces des talents<\/h2><p data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2692\">La communaut\u00e9 de talents au S\u00e9n\u00e9gal se distingue par :<\/p><ul data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2866\"><li data-section-id=\"1q7e6oe\" data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2729\">Une formation acad\u00e9mique solide<\/li><li data-section-id=\"d65xga\" data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2769\">Une excellente ma\u00eetrise du fran\u00e7ais<\/li><li data-section-id=\"1pch16i\" data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2805\">Une bonne capacit\u00e9 d\u2019adaptation<\/li><li data-section-id=\"1rszngg\" data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2866\">Une exp\u00e9rience du t\u00e9l\u00e9travail et des \u00e9quipes distribu\u00e9es<\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2914\">Les comp\u00e9tences couvrent des domaines vari\u00e9s :<\/p><ul data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"3008\"><li data-section-id=\"1hem7e6\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2939\">IT et d\u00e9veloppement<\/li><li data-section-id=\"a6c053\" data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"2959\">Relation client<\/li><li data-section-id=\"g60hdi\" data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"2981\">Marketing digital<\/li><li data-section-id=\"150un21\" data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3008\">Gestion administrative<\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3199\"><strong data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3067\">Pourquoi les talents africains sont-ils comp\u00e9titifs ?<\/strong><br data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3070\" \/>Ils combinent comp\u00e9tences techniques, adaptabilit\u00e9 et efficacit\u00e9 op\u00e9rationnelle, offrant ainsi un excellent rapport qualit\u00e9-co\u00fbt.<\/p><h2 data-section-id=\"1xovpch\" data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3242\">Benchmark des salaires au S\u00e9n\u00e9gal<\/h2><p data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3294\">Quels sont les niveaux de r\u00e9mun\u00e9ration pratiqu\u00e9s ?<\/p><p data-start=\"3296\" data-end=\"3415\">Les salaires varient selon le secteur, l\u2019exp\u00e9rience et les responsabilit\u00e9s. Voici des fourchettes mensuelles estim\u00e9es :<\/p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><h3>Support client<\/h3><ul><li>D\u00e9butant : 400 \u2013 600 EURO \/ mois<\/li><li>Exp\u00e9riment\u00e9 : 600 \u2013 1000 EURO \/ mois<\/li><li>Team leader : 1000 \u2013 1 600 EURO \/ mois<\/li><\/ul><h3>D\u00e9veloppement IT<\/h3><ul><li>D\u00e9veloppeur junior : 800 \u2013 1 300 EURO \/ mois<\/li><li>D\u00e9veloppeur exp\u00e9riment\u00e9 : 1 300 \u2013 2 600 EURO \/ mois<\/li><li>Senior : 2 600 \u2013 4 600 EURO \/ mois<\/li><\/ul><h3>Finance et comptabilit\u00e9<\/h3><ul><li>Junior : 600 \u2013 1000 EURO \/ mois<\/li><li>Exp\u00e9riment\u00e9 : 1000 \u2013 1 900 EURO \/ mois<\/li><li>Senior : 1 900 \u2013 3 600 EURO \/ mois<\/li><\/ul><h3>Marketing digital<\/h3><ul><li>Junior : 500 \u2013 900 EURO \/ mois<\/li><li>Exp\u00e9riment\u00e9 : 900 \u2013 1 600 EURO \/ mois<\/li><li>Responsable : 1 600 \u2013 2 900 EURO \/ mois<\/li><\/ul><p>Ces niveaux permettent aux entreprises de structurer des \u00e9quipes performantes tout en optimisant leur budget.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-029df9a elementor-cta--layout-image-left elementor-cta--tablet-layout-image-above elementor-cta--mobile-layout-image-above elementor-cta--skin-classic elementor-animated-content elementor-bg-transform elementor-bg-transform-zoom-in elementor-widget elementor-widget-call-to-action\" data-id=\"029df9a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"call-to-action.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__bg-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__bg elementor-bg\" style=\"background-image: url(https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Recrutez-des-stagiaires-travaillant-a-distance-copy-1024x541.webp);\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Recrutez-des-stagiaires-travaillant-a-distance-copy.webp\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__bg-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-cta__title elementor-cta__content-item elementor-content-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBreedj connecte les talents \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9chelle mondiale\t\t\t\t\t<\/h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__description elementor-cta__content-item elementor-content-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBreedj est la plateforme technologique qui structure, digitalise et simplifie l\u2019ensemble du processus de collaboration avec une communaut\u00e9 de talents distribu\u00e9e. De l\u2019identification des opportunit\u00e9s au suivi des performances, en passant par la gestion compl\u00e8te de la conformit\u00e9, Breedj offre un cadre transparent et s\u00e9curis\u00e9 pour travailler avec des talents externes.<\/br><\/br>\n\nPr\u00e9sente dans neuf pays et soutenant une communaut\u00e9 de professionnels qualifi\u00e9s, Breedj permet aux entreprises d\u2019acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des talents via des dispositifs externalis\u00e9s, \u00e0 distance, en t\u00e9l\u00e9travail ou en portage salarial, sans n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 de cr\u00e9er une entit\u00e9 locale.\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__button-wrapper elementor-cta__content-item elementor-content-item \">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-cta__button elementor-button elementor-size-\" href=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/fr\/rejoignez-nous\/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDevenez membre Breedj\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79b3bcb elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"79b3bcb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-section-id=\"185945\" data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4177\">D\u00e9fis et conformit\u00e9<\/h2><p data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4260\">Collaborer avec des talents \u00e0 distance n\u00e9cessite de respecter les r\u00e8gles locales.<\/p><p data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4284\">Les principaux d\u00e9fis :<\/p><ul data-start=\"4286\" data-end=\"4383\"><li data-section-id=\"5rhark\" data-start=\"4286\" data-end=\"4310\">Conformit\u00e9 juridique<\/li><li data-section-id=\"cejj2t\" data-start=\"4311\" data-end=\"4335\">Gestion des contrats<\/li><li data-section-id=\"n9jmfo\" data-start=\"4336\" data-end=\"4358\">Gestion de la paie<\/li><li data-section-id=\"dyvr38\" data-start=\"4359\" data-end=\"4383\">Obligations sociales<\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"4385\" data-end=\"4548\"><strong data-start=\"4385\" data-end=\"4439\">Comment travailler l\u00e9galement sans entit\u00e9 locale ?<\/strong><br data-start=\"4439\" data-end=\"4442\" \/>Le mod\u00e8le Employer of Record (EOR) permet de d\u00e9l\u00e9guer ces aspects tout en s\u00e9curisant la collaboration.<\/p><h2 data-section-id=\"2mf19z\" data-start=\"4555\" data-end=\"4588\">Comment travailler avec Breedj<\/h2><p data-start=\"4590\" data-end=\"4688\">Breedj permet de structurer des \u00e9quipes \u00e0 distance ou externalis\u00e9es de mani\u00e8re simple et conforme.<\/p><p data-start=\"4690\" data-end=\"4715\">Les solutions propos\u00e9es :<\/p><ul data-start=\"4717\" data-end=\"4827\"><li data-section-id=\"13qihnk\" data-start=\"4717\" data-end=\"4749\">Employer of Record (EOR)<\/li><li data-section-id=\"cjk8m3\" data-start=\"4750\" data-end=\"4774\">Portage salarial<\/li><li data-section-id=\"1phbtdj\" data-start=\"4775\" data-end=\"4806\">Freelances externalis\u00e9s<\/li><li data-section-id=\"3dtv64\" data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"4827\">Sous-traitance<\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"4829\" data-end=\"4853\">Breedj prend en charge :<\/p><ul data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4983\"><li data-section-id=\"ki6c49\" data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4880\">la gestion de la paie<\/li><li data-section-id=\"m5iwma\" data-start=\"4881\" data-end=\"4919\">la conformit\u00e9 juridique et sociale<\/li><li data-section-id=\"1hek1kk\" data-start=\"4920\" data-end=\"4949\">la gestion administrative<\/li><li data-section-id=\"3z8xj\" data-start=\"4950\" data-end=\"4983\">la mise en place des contrats<\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"4985\" data-end=\"5106\"><strong data-start=\"4985\" data-end=\"5032\">Breedj est-il un Employer of Record (EOR) ?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5032\" data-end=\"5035\" \/>Oui. Breedj permet de collaborer l\u00e9galement sans cr\u00e9er d\u2019entit\u00e9 locale.<\/p><p data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5221\"><strong data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5158\">O\u00f9 trouver des talents qualifi\u00e9s et v\u00e9rifi\u00e9s ?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5158\" data-end=\"5161\" \/>Via la communaut\u00e9 de talents Breedj pr\u00e9sente dans neuf pays.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d77c5d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7d77c5d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\u00a0<\/h3><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Breedj facilite l\u2019acc\u00e8s aux talents<br \/>s\u00e9n\u00e9galais dans un cadre conforme.<\/h3><div>\u00a0<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-400abf7 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"400abf7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md\" href=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/fr\/rejoignez-nous\/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"e